{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:915fab3f9f46dc63","name":"Killik Dartship","source":{"id":"source:reference-915fab3f9f46dc63","title":"Killik Dartship","revision":21360,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:39:24Z","sha256":"dcfc35bf84d93647b5dfe1df9df116e632561f038a808d460b42a5d774b430e6","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21360","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Killik%20Dartship&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-915fab3f9f46dc63","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Killik Hives"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Killik_Hives","referenceId":"reference:0183b5e2769b212c"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Killik Dartship is the Hives' ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"}," analog, constructed of spitcrete and accommodating a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Killik"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Killik","referenceId":"reference:c6a92ca2cfb51db8"}," pilot. The ships are not uniform in design, but all are long and pointed, with pits that house ",{"tag":"a","children":["Laser Cannons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Laser_Cannons"}," and messy rocket propulsion systems. Rare models of Dartships employ ion engines for superior speed and maneuverability.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Because ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Killik Hives"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Killik_Hives","referenceId":"reference:0183b5e2769b212c"}," operate under a single hive-minded consciousness, the loss of any one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Killik"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Killik","referenceId":"reference:c6a92ca2cfb51db8"}," is no more painful than shedding a single drop of blood would be for an individual being. For this reason, the Hives are quick to employ ramming techniques with its Dartships if it believes that the result will be more favorable than continued combat. Dartships on suicide runs approach their target at the same time, making it difficult to shoot them all down without sustaining at least some damage.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Dartships are carried by ",{"tag":"a","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Shard"]},"-Class Capital Ships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shard-Class_Capital_Ships?action=edit&redlink=1"},", which begin at 1,500 meters in length and can reach many times that size. These cone-shaped vessels are built with a redundant honeycomb structure that gives them remarkable hull strength. It is common to see both Dartships and ",{"tag":"a","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Shard"]},"-Class Capital Ships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shard-Class_Capital_Ships?action=edit&redlink=1"}," escorting ",{"tag":"a","children":["Killik Nest Ships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Killik_Nest_Ships?action=edit&redlink=1"},", 8,000-meter behemoths designed to ferry the entire population of a single nest to a new world for relocation and repopulation. All Killik ",{"tag":"a","children":["Capital Ships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Capital_Ships","referenceId":"reference:a08d2e2cd508d403"}," are armed with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Turbolasers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Turbolasers"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Proton Torpedoes"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Proton_Torpedoes","referenceId":"reference:89c41c332c03f2dd"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Skilled)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Killik Dartship Statistics (CL 9)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Huge ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["In